FMutate expressive controls for Dinghy (GPL-3.0-only, preserving upstream attribution).

Adds volatile MIDI pitch bend (0xE0, +-2 semitones, center 8192, endpoints 0/16383,
combined with SMK-37 physical wheel bend, whose stock curve is kept exactly; panel keys follow the bend of the
channel they send on) and per-note square-law MIDI polyphonic
aftertouch (0xA0, 127 unity, 0 silent) via independent per-voice smoothed Q15 gain
with channel/note isolation, new-note/retrigger/reuse reset, and CC120/121/123 recovery.
Neutral sound without pressure/bend is unchanged and persisted settings are untouched.

